msgctxt "128_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey, how's it going? I'm a scout for a hostess club.\\r\nInterested?"
msgstr "¡Mucho gusto! Trabajo como cazatalentos en un\nclub de hostess, ¿le interesa?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "140_Subdued Woman"
msgid "A hostess club, huh? I don't know..."
msgstr "¿Un club de hostess? Bueno, yo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "152_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, I understand completely. You probably have some\\r\nobjections to the industry. But you know..."
msgstr "Ah, ya veo. Supongo que está en contra de ese tipo de “trabajo”, pero, ¿sabe?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "164_Akiyama"
msgid "Just do your best, and you'll be raking in the cash."
msgstr "¡Créame que se hace el mayor esfuerzo para ganar mucho dinero!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "176_Subdued Woman"
msgid "I do need money, but not that badly!"
msgstr "Eso le creo, ¡pero no ganaré dinero así!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "188_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah, I see..."
msgstr "Ah, bueno..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "200_Subdued Woman"
msgid "I'm not interested in the sex industry! Get lost!"
msgstr "¡No me interesa trabajar en cosas sexuales! ¡Adiós!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "212_Akiyama"
msgid "(Yikes. Blew that one...)"
msgstr "(Caray, mis palabras no fueron las correctas...)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "260_Akiyama"
msgid "Haven't you heard? Working as a hostess is a dream job for\\r\nyoung women these days. In fact, hostess club fashion mags\\r\nare all the rage."
msgstr "Trabajar en un club de hostess es el sueño de muchas\nmujeres jóvenes y hermosas, hoy en día estos clubes están\nde moda a tal punto de salir en revistas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "272_Subdued Woman"
msgid "Huh? Really?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿De verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "284_Akiyama"
msgid "Really. Are you sure a cute girl like you wouldn't be\\r\ninterested?"
msgstr "Por ejemplo, una mujer joven y linda como usted, nos vendría bien.\n¿Le interesa?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "296_Subdued Woman"
msgid "Me, cute? Gosh..."
msgstr "¿Yo? ¿Linda? Oh, vaya..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "308_Akiyama"
msgid "It's true! Sure, there's plenty of cute girls around here,\\r\nbut they're not the ones who caught my eye."
msgstr "¡Lo digo en serio! Hay miles de mujeres en estas zonas, pero\nnadie me llamó la atención tanto como usted."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "Be pretty great to make yourself even more fabulous, no?"
msgstr "Ser linda también le beneficia para volverse popular, ¿sabe?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "332_Subdued Woman"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr "Supongo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "344_Akiyama"
msgid "Here's my card, then. Can I get your number?"
msgstr "Tome mi tarjeta. ¿Podría darme su número de teléfono?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "356_Subdued Woman"
msgid "Uh-huh."
msgstr "Ajá."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "380_Akiyama"
msgid "All right, I'll be in touch!"
msgstr "¡Perfecto! Me pondré en contacto con usted."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "428_Akiyama"
msgid "There's a lot of money in it."
msgstr "Ganará mucho dinero, ¡por supuesto!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "440_Akiyama"
msgid "This just might be your dream job."
msgstr "Este podría ser el trabajo de sus sueños."

